  "notes": "{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す means to repeat or do again.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す\n\nFORMS:\n- ⟦{繰|く}り{返|かえ}し→繰り返し：10320_kurikaeshi⟧ (noun): repetition\n- ⟦{繰|く}り{返|かえ}し→繰り返し：10320_kurikaeshi⟧ (adverb): repeatedly\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}される (passive): to be repeated\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{何度|なんど}→何度：17592_nando⟧も{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す: to repeat many times\n- ⟦{同|おな}じ→同じ：02857_onaji⟧⟦{間違|まちが}い→間違い：03733_machigai⟧を{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す: to repeat the same mistake\n- ⟦{練習|れんしゅう}→練習：05323_renshuu⟧を{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す: to practice repeatedly\n\nCONJUGATION (godan-す):\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}さない (negative)\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}して (te-form)\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}した (past)\n\nPROVERB:\n⟦{歴史|れきし}→歴史：02267_rekishi⟧は{繰|く}り{返|かえ}す: History repeats itself.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {繰|く}り{返|かえ}している: is doing ~ repeatedly / keeps doing ~ (habitual/iterative)\n- Note: The ている form typically expresses repeated or habitual action rather than a single ongoing event. ⟦{同|おな}じ→同じ：02857_onaji⟧⟦{間違|まちが}い→間違い：03733_machigai⟧を{繰|く}り{返|かえ}している means \"keeps making the same mistake\" (over time), not \"is in the process of repeating one mistake.\"",
